WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.147 --> 00:00:05.837
- Women surfers have been
marketed very sexually.

00:00:05.837 --> 00:00:08.632
You see a girl in a string
bikini or a g-string standing

00:00:08.632 --> 00:00:10.904
on a beach, but when we go out there

00:00:10.904 --> 00:00:11.737
it's totally different.

00:00:11.737 --> 00:00:14.168
We're wearing full suits
and hoods and booties

00:00:14.168 --> 00:00:16.323
and we're not trying to be sexy.

00:00:16.323 --> 00:00:18.200
We're going out there to become stronger,

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:20.973
better, more awesome humans.

00:00:20.973 --> 00:00:23.331
Big wave surfing is really ferocious.

00:00:23.331 --> 00:00:25.997
People have said that women can't surf it,

00:00:25.997 --> 00:00:27.607
but I do.

00:00:27.607 --> 00:00:30.190
(upbeat music)

00:00:34.384 --> 00:00:36.070
I'm Bianca Valenti and I'm a professional

00:00:36.070 --> 00:00:40.016
Big Wave Surfer in San
Francisco, California.

00:00:40.016 --> 00:00:42.971
11 years ago is when I first
surfed in San Francisco.

00:00:42.971 --> 00:00:44.539
I nearly drowned.

00:00:44.539 --> 00:00:46.374
And that is when I decided I wanted to put

00:00:46.374 --> 00:00:49.488
in the time in and out of
the water and start training

00:00:49.488 --> 00:00:51.988
to prepare and ride big waves.

00:00:53.702 --> 00:00:56.208
The water in San Francisco
is really really cold.

00:00:56.208 --> 00:00:59.056
Sometimes there's even ice
on the sand in the morning

00:00:59.056 --> 00:01:02.107
and when it's super cold
you're hands are tingly.

00:01:02.107 --> 00:01:03.331
You have to have a really thick skin

00:01:03.331 --> 00:01:05.734
and you have to be very
driven, determined,

00:01:05.734 --> 00:01:09.067
and motivated because this isn't Hawaii.

00:01:10.715 --> 00:01:14.672
Mavericks is a surf spot
where gigantic waves break.

00:01:14.672 --> 00:01:17.872
It's been called the
Mount Everest of surfing

00:01:17.872 --> 00:01:22.039
and it is located 20 minutes
south of San Francisco.

00:01:23.846 --> 00:01:26.329
An average size wave
is three to four feet.

00:01:26.329 --> 00:01:28.953
Mavericks starts breaking at 15 feet

00:01:28.953 --> 00:01:33.286
and there's been waves
ridden there up to 100 feet.

00:01:33.286 --> 00:01:35.152
People have died surfing Mavericks.

00:01:35.152 --> 00:01:36.240
It is serious business.

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:38.480
It is for experts only.

00:01:38.480 --> 00:01:41.531
There's excitement,
there's fear, adrenaline,

00:01:41.531 --> 00:01:43.448
nervousness, happiness.

00:01:45.594 --> 00:01:48.614
It's really every emotion at once.

00:01:48.614 --> 00:01:52.358
When I hear somebody say that
women are not strong enough

00:01:52.358 --> 00:01:54.267
or good enough to surf big waves,

00:01:54.267 --> 00:01:56.560
I just start laughing because
it makes me feel alive

00:01:56.560 --> 00:01:58.181
and I love it.

00:01:58.181 --> 00:01:59.654
It's about challenging yourself.

00:01:59.654 --> 00:02:03.846
It's about persevering
and overcoming obstacles

00:02:03.846 --> 00:02:08.336
and so it's a much deeper
experience for me personally

00:02:08.336 --> 00:02:12.503
and that's why I embrace
surfing in San Francisco.

00:02:13.802 --> 00:02:16.385
(upbeat music)

